## On a file

    ce-drive link notes/q3.md --rel about ocean://doc/e5f51c6dd405

ce-drive stores that as a typed link in its metadata layer, alongside props and tags.
`LinkTarget::Uri` is never dereferenced by the drive — it records the edge and nothing
